  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The Psychic damage of your Brand of Castigation increases to twice your Intelligence modifier (minimum of 2). In addition, a creature branded by you can't take the Dash action, and whenever it attempts to teleport or to leave its current plane by any means, it takes 4d6 Psychic damage and must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against your Hemocraft save DC or have the attempt fail.</p>",
